  "prefLabel": "Env-A 1202.57 EMI/RFI shielding",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 1202.57 “EMI/RFI shielding” means a coating used on electrical or electronic equipment to provide shielding against electromagnetic interference (EMI), radio frequency interference (RFI), or static discharge.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Env-A 1200) #9933, eff 6-1-11; ss by #12899, eff 10-17-19",
